; orchard_mill_town.room - Vila dos Moinhos (design 04 section 3.6): flat main street from the terraces (east) to the leaf path (west); inn door at col 30.
; Soltar on the inn roof drops the 6-cell drawbridge east (raised, it stands rows 0-5, inside this room). From its end a double jump
; rises through the one-way loft (row 0, under the counterweights mouth) and lands on it. Raised, the bridge seals the roof's east end
; against windy_gap's ledge; from the street and yard the loft is 288 and 352 px up (double jump 270).
; The dovecote ledge (row 3) is the double-jump launch onto orchard_windy_gap's east ledge (cols 36-38, six rows up).

